; No replay driver: DEMOREC/DEMOPLAY are world console commands that any client could reach through ServerExec.
-NetDriverDefinitions=(DefName="DemoNetDriver",DriverClassName="/Script/Engine.DemoNetDriver",DriverClassNameFallback="/Script/Engine.DemoNetDriver")
; GameNetDriver: EOS P2P once a code game is logged in (Source/GuessWho/GWOnline.cpp), IP otherwise
